# aidd / agent-generated artifacts
# Derived from aidd's artifact catalog: ignore exactly the runtime/generated/secret rows;
# everything else under .aidd/ is a durable blueprint and is committed on purpose.
# generated — reproducible by re-running the producer
.aidd/_common/
.aidd/.artifacts-check.json
.aidd/audit-reports/
.aidd/audits/
.aidd/feature-review-report.md
.aidd/remediation-review.md
.aidd/reports/
.aidd/response-review.md
.aidd/skills/
# runtime — meaningful only for the run that wrote it
.aidd/active-runs/
.aidd/iterations/
.aidd/runs.jsonl
.aidd/.stop
# secret — provider API keys, web.authToken, botToken; never commit
.aidd/aidd.config.json

